# The genuine standard real two-sphere underlying the native Riemann sphere

`CuspCircleNormalTrivialization.RealSphere.sphereDiffeomorph` identifies
`RiemannSphere` with the unit sphere in `EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin 3)`.
It is real analytic for the unchanged reciprocal affine atlas on the
source and the unchanged stereographic atlas on the target. The actual
map is the explicit isometric stereographic construction, including the
checked conjugate-antipodal formula in the infinity chart.
